- Single line. ASCII letters only.
- PascalCase: each word starts uppercase, rest lowercase.
- The identifier MUST contain EXACTLY the requested number of words. No more, no less.
- Count words by capital letters: "UserProfileCard" = 3 words, "Submit" = 1 word.
- No quotes, no markdown, no explanation, no prefixes like "Identifier:". Output the identifier and nothing else."""

